<title>SPAIN: Vallehermoso 9-mth profit up 4.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Vallehermoso 9-mth profit up 4.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for Spanish property group Vallehermoso in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Attributable profit		  3.92	up    4.8 pct</p>
<p> Pretax profit			  5.90	up    8   pct</p>
<p> Sales				   29.30	up   36.8 pct</p>
<p> Rental income			  4.92	up    5.5 pct</p>
<p>Note: The company said the residential market now presented a more favourable picture than in previous years due to positive macroeconomic factors including lower interest rates.</p>
<p>The market for office space was also encouraging and the company expects it to recover sharply in the coming months given that rent prices are now more constant.</p>
<p>Total investment was over 28 billion for the first nine months of the year, including investment in property to be sold of 18.80 billion.</p>
<p>Fixed asset investment for the first nine months totalled 3.29 billion pesetas and investment in land was 6.00 billion.</p>
</text>
